OL,3,GNEWSAResidents advised to close windows
OL,4,Aas fire service tackles blaze
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents have been asked to keep their
OL,7,Fwindows and doors closed as
OL,8,Ffirefighters tackle a blaze at a
OL,9,Fderelict building in County Antrim.
OL,11,FThe Northern Ireland Fire and Rescue
OL,12,FService (NIFRS) said crews are
OL,13,Fattending the fire on Cloughfern Avenue
OL,14,Fin Monkstown Industrial Estate.
OL,16,FSeven fire appliances, an aerial
OL,17,Fappliance and a command support unit
OL,18,Fare at the scene, with 53 operational
OL,19,Fpersonnel in attendance.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
